<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Welcome to Tanika Interior Design</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        color: #333;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 30px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 5px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .header {
        text-align: center;
        background-color: #202a44;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 20px;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #777;
      }

    .contant{
      line-height: 0;

    }

     .contant a{
      text-decoration: none;
    
      
    }


      .logo {
        max-width: 120px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to Tanika Interior Design</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Dear <%= user.name %>,</p>

        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>Tanika Interior Design</strong>! We’re excited to begin this journey of transforming your home into a space that truly reflects your vision and personality. Our team is dedicated to delivering quality craftsmanship, creative design, and timely execution — all tailored to your specific needs and lifestyle.
        </p>

        <p>
          Starting today, you will receive <strong>daily updates</strong> on the progress of your home interior work. These updates will include photos, key highlights, and notes from the site to keep you informed and engaged throughout the process. You may have recieved your login crendential via Email.
        </p>

        <p>
          In addition, every <strong>Monday</strong>, you’ll receive a neatly organized <strong>weekly progress report</strong> summarizing the work completed, upcoming milestones, and any key decisions needed from your end. Thank you once again for choosing us — we’re committed to making this an enjoyable and satisfying experience for you and your family.
        </p>

        <p>Warm regards,<br /><strong>Team Tanika</strong><br />Transforming spaces. Creating stories.</p>
             <div class="contant">
            <h5>Email: <a href="mailto:bhavy203@gmail.com">bhavy203@gmail.com</a></h5>
            <h5>Phone: <a href="tel:+12342342345">12342342345</a></h5>
            <h5>Address: 123 Business Rd, Business City, BC 12345</h5>
          </div>

      </div>

 
      <div class="footer">
        © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Tanika Interior Design. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
